{"availability":"available","full":"Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine","name":"Marinara-Engine","description":"AI frontend","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":705,"forks":202,"created":"2026-03-04T15:37:29Z","updated":"2026-10-11T08:52:54Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://spicymarinara.github.io/","topics":["ai","ai-agents","ai-agents-framework","frontend","local"],"demo":"https://spicymarinara.github.io/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:18.959Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:18.959Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:18.959Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T09:01:18.959Z","stars":705,"forks":202}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A local, AI-powered chat, roleplay, and game engine built around one idea: you install it, you run it, and it just works. Oh, and don't forget about the part where you have fun! ALSO, HEY, LOOK, IT'S FREE.","Created with agentic use in mind, allowing multiple requests at once. Everything is connected. Chat with your characters OOC about your roleplays. Have them create RP scenes for you. All designed with simplicity in mind: we don't want to spend hours on setup, we just want to play.","This is a full-on passion project; it started as a small personal playground, but over time it grew into something enormous. Thank you all for your support."],"features":["Three chat modes — Conversation (Discord-style DMs), Roleplay (immersive RPG with sprites and backgrounds), and Game (AI Game Master with party, quests, and combat). Characters can share memory across modes. Create or…","Character sprites for expressions and full-body poses, including animated expressions, custom scene backgrounds, dynamic weather effects, a Visual Novel display for Roleplay, chat galleries with generated illustrations,…","Colors and style: dark or light mode, the Marinara (retro Y2K) or SillyTavern-inspired look, background and accent colors (solid or gradient, with optional pulsing or rainbow accents), and a custom cursor.","Fonts and sizes: pick the app font, add your own font files or download any Google Font, and adjust the display size, chat text size and colors, text outlines, and desktop sidebar width.","Chat widgets: style the movable chat buttons, windows, and sections with the Default, Dottore, or Mari preset, then change their font, shape, colors (gradients too), and button size. Three switches let your messages and…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a59fa8b3c8d8221037d08621b9bbf1b38a7704feef680480b9b48fa88246259a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:19.208Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:19.208Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A local, AI-powered chat, roleplay, and game engine built around one idea: you install it, you run it, and it just works. Oh, and don't forget about the part where you have fun! ALSO, HEY, LOOK, IT'S FREE.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You sign in once on the computer that runs Marinara.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Images: cloud services such as OpenAI, NovelAI, Stability AI, OpenRouter, and fal.ai, your ChatGPT login, free Pollinations and Stable Horde, and local ComfyUI, SD Web UI, SwarmUI, and Draw Things.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"a59fa8b3c8d8221037d08621b9bbf1b38a7704feef680480b9b48fa88246259a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T09:01:19.209Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T08:52:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Pasta-Devs/Marinara-Engine/blob/main/README.md","checked